---
import MainLayout from '@/layouts/MainLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = 'Terms of Service | Crestivo';
---

<MainLayout title={pageTitle}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-[85rem] px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>

      <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-neutral-500 dark:text-neutral-400">
        Last updated: January 1, 2021
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
          <p>By accessing or using Crestivo's website and services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">2. Our Services</h2>
          <p>Crestivo provides marketing and technology services including but not limited to website development, QR code creation, video production, animations, business blueprints, branding, and digital content creation for businesses and individuals.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">3. Payments</h2>
          <p>All payments are processed securely through Stripe. By purchasing a service you agree to pay the listed price at the time of purchase. All sales are final unless otherwise agreed upon in writing. Our price match guarantee applies at the time of purchase only.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">4. Price Match Guarantee</h2>
          <p>Crestivo offers a price match guarantee on all services. To claim a price match, you must provide a verifiable quote from a competing service provider offering the same or similar service. We reserve the right to verify all price match requests before honoring them.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">5. Delivery of Services</h2>
          <p>Crestivo will deliver all purchased services within the timeframe communicated at the time of purchase. Most projects are completed within days. Timelines may vary depending on the complexity of the project and the responsiveness of the client.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">6. Client Responsibilities</h2>
          <p>Clients are responsible for providing accurate information, timely feedback, and any content or materials required to complete the project. Delays caused by the client may affect project timelines.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">7. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>Upon full payment, clients receive full ownership of all deliverables created specifically for them. Crestivo retains the right to display completed work in its portfolio unless otherwise agreed upon in writing.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>Crestivo is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our services. Our total liability shall not exceed the amount paid for the specific service in question.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">9. Changes to Terms</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to update these Terms of Service at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. Continued use of our services after changes are posted constitutes your acceptance of the updated terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-200">10. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-medium text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400">Propertiesonlinellc@outlook.com</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">154 W 14th St, New York, NY 10011</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
